@startuml
!theme plain

title Idea Development Workflow

(*) --> "💡 Spark: New idea"
"💡 Spark: New idea" --> "📁 Create folder\nunder topics/"
"📁 Create folder\nunder topics/" --> "📝 Draft problem.md\n& solution.md"
"📝 Draft problem.md\n& solution.md" --> "🎨 Sketch diagrams\n(drawio/plantuml)"
"🎨 Sketch diagrams\n(drawio/plantuml)" --> "💼 Define business\nmodel"
"💼 Define business\nmodel" --> "🏗️ Design\narchitecture"
"🏗️ Design\narchitecture" --> "🚀 Scope MVP"
"🚀 Scope MVP" --> "📊 Review &\niterate"
"📊 Review &\niterate" --> [Yes] "📈 Status: Concept"
"📊 Review &\niterate" --> [No] "📝 Refine docs"
"📝 Refine docs" --> "📊 Review &\niterate"
"📈 Status: Concept" --> "🛠️ Build MVP?"
"🛠️ Build MVP?" --> [Yes] "💻 Move to\nseparate repo"
"🛠️ Build MVP?" --> [No] "🗄️ Archive"

"💻 Move to\nseparate repo" as B
B --> (*)

"🗄️ Archive" as A
A --> "💤 Dormant"
"💤 Dormant" --> (*)

@enduml
